196 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\042Footy tipping\042 is the term for office pools where players nominate which teams will win that week\056 Well\054 we had our starting point for the new game\056\n\nMatch 10 games are a chance for people to place what is essentially a large accumulator bet on the results of football matches\056 The pools require you to select 10 matches on your coupon and for you to be successful you need to pick 8 games that finish as a 2\0552 draw or greater to win\056 If you are successful then you will have the opportunity to win a share of the prize pool on offer\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 195 0 R
     /Pg 184 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

